 "nl": [
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to dmz-web using NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Block SNMP (UDP 161) from student-lab to iot-sensors; the rest of any UDP port between them is allowed.",
  "voip is isolated: it may only reach edge-cache on HTTPS (TCP 443); scada on DNS over UDP 53, and nothing else.",
  "Block TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161) from student-lab to library; the rest of any UDP port between them is allowed.",
  "Restrict iot-sensors so that its only permitted destinations are dmz-web on DNS over UDP 53; edge-cache on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow dev-lab to connect to voip using RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Apart from voip on NTP (UDP 123); edge-cache on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in library must be dropped.",
  "Hosts in library may reach scada over LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach vpn-users over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Hosts in dmz-web may reach library over SNMP (UDP 161) and SMTP (TCP 25) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "edge-cache must accept SMTP (TCP 25) and SNMP (UDP 161) and SSH (TCP 22) from scada.",
  "edge-cache offers HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach student-lab over IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Any zone may connect to iot-sensors over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "edge-cache must accept RDP (TCP 3389) and SMB (TCP 445) and MySQL (TCP 3306) from voip.",
  "vpn-users must accept RDP (TCP 3389) and RTSP (TCP 554) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from voip.",
  "voip must accept IMAP (TCP 143) from vpn-users.",
  "dev-lab must never reach scada, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Any zone may connect to iot-sensors over DNS over UDP 53 and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Allow student-lab to connect to dmz-web using RDP (TCP 3389) and HTTP (TCP 80) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Hosts in dev-lab may reach student-lab over IMAP (TCP 143) and LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "edge-cache must accept IMAP (TCP 143) and LDAP (TCP 389) and RTSP (TCP 554) from scada.",
  "Block MySQL (TCP 3306), RDP (TCP 3389) from voip to iot-sensors; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "edge-cache must accept SSH (TCP 22) from admin.",
  "Any zone may connect to admin over DNS over UDP 53 and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach voip over SSH (TCP 22) and SMB (TCP 445) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "edge-cache may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards dmz-web, except PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked."
 ],
